{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Collection Item","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404024","type":"Type"}],"id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/library/7435","identified_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"repository number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404621"}],"content":"7435","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"call number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300311706"}],"content":"PQ2643.A26 V36","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"preferred term","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404670"}],"content":"Variety: second series ","type":"Name"}],"produced_by":{"carried_out_by":[{"_label":"Valéry, Paul,","id":"actor/valery-paul","type":"Actor"},{"_label":"Harcourt Brace \u0026 Company","id":"actor/harcourt-brace-and-company","type":"Actor"}],"timespan":{"_label":"c1938","type":"TimeSpan"},"type":"Production"},"referred_to_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"inscription statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435414"}],"content":"grl copy : good condition ; dust jacket : good condition.|Inscription on front loose endpaper from Alfred Stieglitz to Georgia O'Keeffe, July 3, 1940 : For Georgia / from Alfred / July 3 / 40.","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"description statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"}],"content":"From Georgia O'Keeffe's Ghost Ranch library.\nThe essays...have, with one exception, been drawn from Variété II, published in France in 1930; Pieces sur l'art, published in France in 1934; and Variété III, published in France in 1936. The exception is the first essay in the book, 'Villon and Verlaine'.--Publisher's note.","type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[],"type":"HumanMadeObject"}